><p>Give a path-independent choice correspondence that no preference rationalizes.</p></div></div></li></ol><div class=\"pq-ans pq-ans--whole\" data-answer><p class=\"pq-ans-k\">Answer</p><div class=\"ue-math\"><p>Machine-checked under this reading: (a), (b) and (d) as printed, and (c) with the added full-domain condition. On an arbitrary domain, (c) does not hold in this reading.</p></div></div>"}